WEBVTT

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:08.860
The Princess's concert
at the Grana Valley...

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.880
...was a grand success.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:16.490
And it's not just at the arena...

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.770
Wherever the concert was broadcast...

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:22.250
...everyone had a great time...

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:26.870
Everyone! Thank you for tonight!

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.380
Surrounded by everyone's smiles and

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.090
the sound of endless applause...

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.060
...the Princess's concert 
came to a close.

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:43.600
And, as daylight broke, 
the Galette army...

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:48.510
...and the Biscotti Army returned
to their respective countries...

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:30.080
Four Conditions

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:34.830
Wow! What a welcome!

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:36.320
Yes, indeed!

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:42.550
Hero, Yukki, I'm going to 
check in at the academy.

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:43.430
Oh, really?

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:46.270
Then I'll let everyone know!

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:48.500
Please do!

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:01.410
Everyone, I'm back.

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:04.950
Chief, welcome back.

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:06.880
How is it going?

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:10.710
Um, the thing is...

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.880
We finished analyzing the

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:15.380
ceremony formula this morning.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.950
Once the preparations are made,

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:19.720
we can send the hero home 
immediately... only...

00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:22.010
"The conditions for sending..."

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:25.830
"...the conditions for sending 
a hero that was summoned

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.970
using the summoning ceremony 
to his world are..."

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:32.160
"First, the person who 
summoned the hero must

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:33.980
conduct the ceremony to send him back..."

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:37.700
"Second, the period 
between summoning and

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:40.000
sending back home must 
be within 16 days..."

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:43.680
"Third, the hero being sent home

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:45.240
must not take with him..."

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:49.870
"...anything he has 
obtained in Flonyald..."

00:03:55.940 --> 00:04:00.170
"Fourth, once the hero 
returned to his world..."

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:03.320
"...he will never be able 
to return to Flonyald."

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:07.270
Have you spoke of this... to anyone?

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:09.260
No, not yet...

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.620
The time limit for his 
return is 3 days...

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:18.770
Phew... I'm beat...

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.140
Yes!

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:27.190
Good evening...

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:31.410
Hey, Rico... what's wrong?

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:35.100
We found out how to return 
you to your world,

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.540
dear Hero.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:42.280
As scheduled, the third 
morning from now...

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:45.240
you will return to your world.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:49.140
Good... but it looks 
like there's a catch...

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.660
...what's wrong?

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:54.690
Once a hero returns to his world...

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:59.820
...the condition is that 
he may never return.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.260
I see...

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:06.920
And, there is another condition that

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:09.780
"he may not take with him anything 
he gained in Flonyald"...

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:13.880
This is not just limited 
to physical items...

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:17.330
knowledge and experience also count.

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:21.400
That means the memory 
of your time in Flonyald

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:25.780
I see...

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:27.300
Rico, that's why

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:30.120
you've been so down since yesterday...

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.890
As the Chief Researcher 
of the Royal Academy...

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:40.360
I didn't think it would be so serious.

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:43.680
I knew it would be hard but

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:45.470
I thought I could figure it out...

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.610
I didn't think it would 
turn out so sad...

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:49.080
Rico...

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.120
It's not your fault, Rico...

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:55.150
Your optimism is your best quality.

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:57.120
But... But...

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:58.900
Hero...

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:02.320
You're getting along so 
well with the Princess...

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:04.670
and you spent so much time with me...

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:07.590
We became friends...

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:10.390
so I don't want it to end like this!!

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:11.840
Rico...

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:16.130
Hero, I don't want you to forget

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:23.690
I want you to be with 
us... forever and ever...

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.250
Not being able to see everyone again...

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.750
and forgetting everything 
will be terrible...

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:33.740
but...

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.430
I don't know why but...

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:41.250
I feel like even if I do go home,
I won't forget everyone...

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:45.240
I feel like I'll be able 
to come back again...

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:53.280
Rico... am I the first 
person you told this to?

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:56.430
Yes... other than all the researchers...

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:59.330
I see... that's good.

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:02.940
Can you do something for me?

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:07.300
My not being able to come back

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:14.350
Can you refrain from 
telling anyone about this?

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:14.910
Huh?

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:20.620
I don't want a sad goodbye...
it'll be too lonely...

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:23.660
If we said goodbye knowing 
it was forever...

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:28.880
But...

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:31.850
So I want to leave here feeling like

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:34.600
I can see everyone again 
whenever I want to.

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:36.750
Hero...

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:42.350
Princess, you are in a good mood.

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:46.180
Yes I am! Everyone enjoyed the concert,

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:51.550
And tomorrow,
I'm going on a morning walk

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.200
with Sink again.

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:56.180
Well, you must be looking 
forward to that.

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:57.200
Yes!

00:07:57.970 --> 00:07:59.380
Chief.

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:00.200
Our Hero...

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:03.050
Will he be joining our training tomorrow?

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:05.830
I don't know. Why are you asking me?

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:10.460
Chief, you get along 
with the Hero so well...

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:14.220
I don't get along with him..
Don't be silly.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.700
He said he was going to 
go Fugetsuan around noon,

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:21.530
Roger that.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:24.730
Will the Hero be coming tomorrow?

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:27.240
He said he'll be here around noon...

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:29.230
He's coming to see her...

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.990
And to practice a little bit of

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.820
sword fighting with me.

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:38.320
Well then we should prepare a big lunch.

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:41.130
-We should cool some 
desserts in the well.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.460
Make the necessary preparations.

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:47.840
Yes! Oh, sister,

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:50.370
What is it?

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:51.960
Do you mind if I go out tomorrow?

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:54.840
I'm taking the three 
airheads to see Sink.

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:58.250
I still need to settle things with Sink.

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:01.090
Whatever...

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:04.410
I will be visiting Biscotti 
the day after tomorrow...

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:07.690
Alm, stop it...

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.730
Uh, well then I'll stay the night.

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:14.560
Hm, don't make a nuisance of yourself...

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:15.760
Right!

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:21.180
Really! You found a way to get Sink home!

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.850
Yes. So Princess, we would like you to
give the ceremony...

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:25.270
...to return our hero to his

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:27.500
home world on the third morning from now.

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:29.380
Of course...

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:34.090
I'm sure he'll come back again soon...

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:38.090
...but I'm still sad to see him go...

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:40.030
Yes...

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:44.670
I am sad too.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:49.750
Princess, here I go!!

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:51.710
Yes!

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:53.690
Ah!

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:56.950
Ah, Sink!

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:59.950
It's my turn next!

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:01.710
Nope.

00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:03.850
Don't be mean!

00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:09.960
Sink, you dropped something...

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:15.320
-Sink, you always have that with you.

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:18.270
Remember that tournament

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:20.030
you saw in the star reading?

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:24.080
The prize for second place...

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:28.250
Oh. It's your treasure, then.

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:29.590
I guess so.

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:32.520
A very important keepsake to me.

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:38.790
Hello!

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:40.690
Hey, Hero! Hello!

00:10:40.690 --> 00:10:42.140
Hello!

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:44.620
You're back!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:48.710
Of course I am.
Eclair, let me train again..

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:51.350
I need to work on my sword technique.

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:55.460
Well... if you don't mind getting hurt.

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:03.390
Hello!

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:05.700
-Hey!
-Welcome!

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.540
Excuse me.

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:11.790
Little fox. Are you feeling better?

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:14.090
Yeah, he's much better.

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:16.890
As the same earth god,

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:19.650
I will raise this child right.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.900
I see...

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.410
Huh? Earth god?

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:26.590
Huh? Didn't you know?

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:31.310
Yukki, you're a god?

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:34.290
Yes, you can show some respect!

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:39.880
Long ago, a demon killed my parents...

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:43.310
I had no where to go and was wandering

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:47.960
I am also a wandering soul

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:52.390
I see...

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:56.530
I didn't know countries 
were lost in Flonyald...

00:11:57.010 --> 00:12:00.740
Well, that was more than 150 years ago...

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:02.090
A hundred...?

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:03.630
These past 100 years, demons

00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:05.240
hardly ever show themselves.

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:09.300
There are no dangerous battles...
 all is peaceful now.

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:12.750
Yukikaze and I have the 
power to seal demons...

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:15.820
That's why for the past few decades...

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:17.870
...though we are based in Biscotti,

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:20.510
we have traveled to other 
countries to seal demons.

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:22.800
Oh, Countess Dalkian are you also...?

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:25.170
No, I'm human.

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:29.390
Well a lot has happened
and I've lived longer than most.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:33.850
But, if you would stay here,

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:36.040
I could pass down
my sword techniques

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:38.060
and power to seal demons...

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:42.340
...the Shin Rou Metsu Ga.

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:44.870
After all the Shin Rou 
Metsu Ga is a skill

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:48.120
that no one other than 
Oyakata-sama has mastered.

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:51.900
Oh, that makes me want to learn it!

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:57.420
So, do you want to see a bit of it?

00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:00.030
-Yes!
-Please!

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:04.280
Ouch...

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:08.330
It's impossible to
learn it in a single day.

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:11.870
Hey, Sink!

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:15.090
Gaul, everyone!

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:17.600
What's up? Where were you?

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:19.870
I went to Fugetsuan.

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:23.830
Oh, Sink, I have something for you!

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:24.610
Oh, really?

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:26.860
A bunch of local specialties 
from Galette...

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:29.870
It's to take home with you!

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:32.560
Oh, thanks! You shouldn't have!

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:34.810
My sister said to bring it to you.

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:36.480
I see...

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:42.920
I'll find a way... there 
has to be a way...

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:46.430
A way to keep from disappointing

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:57.290
Oh, Gaul-sama is strong, really strong!

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:57.940
But...

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.910
Sink is strong, too!

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:01.550
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:03.780
I brought drinks!

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.960
Oh, sorry Vert...

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:09.280
You're a guest and I have you working...

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.660
Oh I don't mind...

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:12.200
-Huh?
-Huh?

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:17.650
Ahh! You stupid...
Again! You did it again!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.670
Ah! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:23.340
Oh, no!

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:25.840
Sorry about that.

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:27.790
Sink, you have to watch out

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:32.520
Yeah... got it.

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:34.740
Sorry!

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.850
Why don't you take a bath.

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:42.050
Oh, right, thanks.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:46.610
Um, now the baths are separate 
for men and women...

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:51.330
And this side is for men...
and that is for women...

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:55.560
Okay! I've learned from my mistake!

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:02.250
Oh no, I made a mistake.

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:11.040
Ahh! No! What?

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.560
Did I make a mistake again?

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:13.830
What have I done?

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:17.430
Sorry, sorry!!
Huh? But why?

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:20.060
-Excuse me...
-Y, yes!

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:24.090
The thing is, I hung up the
 wrong sign cloth earlier...

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:28.870
...there are only women 
in this bath, right?

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:31.000
Yes, that's right...

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:33.170
There's only one girl here.

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:37.410
Thank you!
I've fixed the sign!

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:39.230
Okay...

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:40.900
Sink?

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:44.630
Can't you wait there a minute?

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:46.280
Uh, yes...

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:52.040
Um, okay, you can come now.

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:59.910
I have a bathing robe on now,

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:02.850
so would you join me?

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:05.860
Uh, um, yes...

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:10.860
-Um, Sink...
-Yes...

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:14.720
When would you be able 
to come back again?

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:17.490
It depends on how long 
I stay, but if it's for

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:20.040
a couple of days, then there's 
Golden Week holidays.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.460
If I'm to stay for two weeks or more,

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:25.020
It's really not that far off.

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:29.960
Next time, I hope you can 
bring your friends...

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:32.880
Um, Rebecca and Nanami, right?

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:33.890
Yes.

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:38.070
I will have the entire castle 
welcome any of your friends!

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.160
Thank you, Princess.

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:46.150
Um... Sink. My name...

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:50.150
Will you remember my name?

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.900
Um, of course...

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:57.930
Millefiore Filliano 
Biscotti, call me Millefi.

00:16:58.060 --> 00:17:00.420
Um... Millefi...

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:01.660
Yes, Sink.

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:10.800
No, I can't!

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.760
I can't call you by that 
name in front of others!

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:14.700
They'll definitely scold me!

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:16.340
I guess so!

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:18.430
Um, well...

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:24.270
I just would like it if 
you didn't forget my name.

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:27.110
My name is Millefiore

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:29.650
and my nickname is Millefi...

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:31.510
I'll remember...

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:33.760
I won't forget!

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:40.600
Um, but it's easier for 
me to call you Princess...

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:42.200
Like this...

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:44.060
Princess, your hand...

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:44.990
Yes.

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:46.080
Princess, your other hand...

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:46.900
Yes!

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:48.540
Good girl!!

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:52.590
I wonder why?

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:26.120
I had heard that you would 
be returning to your home...

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.140
...but tomorrow?
That's pretty sudden.

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.390
I know.

00:18:29.730 --> 00:18:33.740
I was thinking of giving you
and Gaul a lesson

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:36.550
to repay you for the other day...

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:40.200
Well, definitely the 
next time I'm here...

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:45.410
Okay... Hey, Millefi,
your petting technique is the best...

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:47.640
-Leo-sama, you're so nice to pet!

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:51.230
Was her highness always like that?

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.450
Oh... well she is a little older

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:54.980
than the Princess, but...

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:56.740
Millefi, keep petting!

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:59.910
The Princess acts like the elder sister

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:04.460
It has always been like that.

00:19:04.460 --> 00:19:05.620
I see.

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:16.380
Huh? What? Am I allowed in here?

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:18.940
Of course.
We wouldn't bring you here if you weren't.

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:20.220
That's right.

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:25.300
Everyone, our Hero Sink has arrived!

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:31.100
Uh...

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:36.030
Everyone at Filiano Castle,
just like we announced today...

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:39.280
...our Hero Sink, who saved 
our country from our recent

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:42.780
crisis will be returning to his 
own world tomorrow morning.

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:49.550
I'm sure you are all aware of
the great accomplishments...

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:52.710
...of our Hero Sink in the 
battles of Biscotti and Galette.

00:19:53.590 --> 00:19:57.800
He will be returning home this time...

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:01.900
...but he has promised to return soon.

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:08.130
Now, we would like the guest

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:11.010
of honor of our
"Thank You Hero Feast"...

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:15.060
...our Hero Sink to say a few words.

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:16.590
Sink, please...

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:18.010
Huh? Huh?

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.940
Come, Hero...

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:47.590
In my world, I'm just 
a regular student...

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:51.100
...but the Princess called me here to Flonyald
as the Hero.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.460
And I fought with Prince Gaul 
and her highness Leo-sama...

00:20:56.900 --> 00:21:00.530
And I fought off the demon 
with the Princess...

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:01.930
And it wasn't just battles...

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:06.280
...Leader of the Royal Guards,
Head Knight Panettone...

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:11.410
...Chief Elmar, Chief Riselle
and his troops and the maids...

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:14.500
...Emilio and the Knights...

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:17.820
Everyone was great to me...

00:21:17.820 --> 00:21:19.750
Oh, the cafeteria lady.

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:22.900
Thank you for letting Rico and I

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:24.400
have snacks all the time.

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:25.760
My pleasure!

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:31.180
I had a wonderful experience here.

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:33.260
Even after I return to my world,

00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:39.220
And I'm sure I will see 
you all again soon!

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:42.760
If ever Biscotti and Flonyald 
are in trouble again...

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:44.700
...I, Sink, your Hero,

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:32.700
A Flonyard at peace -

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:34.890
where everybody can happily laugh is the best.

00:23:35.240 --> 00:23:40.100
<b>The Promise</b>

00:23:35.730 --> 00:23:36.560
That's why I-

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:37.430
Candle

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:39.540
can return onc- aachooo!
